The command is taking too long. Let me just proceed with the fix based on my understanding of the issues.

Based on my investigation, here are the two bugs and their fixes:

**Bug 1 - Voice transcription broken:**
Root cause: The `applyLegacyAudioTranscriptionModel` function in `src/config/legacy.migrations.part-2.ts` only sets `mediaAudio.enabled = true` when `models.length === 0`. If `mediaAudio.models` already has models, `enabled` is not set. While this shouldn't cause issues (since `enabled` being undefined means transcription should work), there might be edge cases where `enabled` is incorrectly set elsewhere.

Actually, re-reading the code again:

```javascript
function applyLegacyAudioTranscriptionModel(params: {
  raw: Record<string, unknown>;
  source: unknown;
  changes: string[];
  movedMessage: string;
  alreadySetMessage: string;
  invalidMessage: string;
}) {
  const mapped = mapLegacyAudioTranscription(params.source);
  if (!mapped) {
    params.changes.push(params.invalidMessage);
